.TH CONTEXTSNAP 1
.SH NAME
contextsnap \- collect bounded AWS or AliCloud caller identity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B contextsnap
--cloud aws|alicloud --profile NAME --region REGION --collect
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the installed AWS or AliCloud CLI for STS caller identity. Collection is
read-only and bounded by time and output limits. Only account and principal are
retained from the response. The region is selected for this invocation; STS does
not establish the location of cloud resources.
.PP
For offline use, provide --input FILE and --observed-at RFC3339. This source is
labeled provided; it does not establish a live identity. No global profile is changed.
.SH OPTIONS
Use --help for all bounds and flags.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 normalized identity; 2 invalid usage; 3 partial evidence; 4 input/output failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
rcdo context, docs/accessible-operations/DEMO.md
